+- OC outline OR fix (2026-11-06): a plain PubChem side now suppresses the `verdict-oc-mismatch` outline in `fMulerApplyOCVerdict` (either oracle agreeing = white/correct, e.g. propanedioic/propanenitrile) — the one-way gap in the merged-verdict rule; first attempt checked a nonexistent `status === "match"` (`fMatchEngineEN` emits systematic/retained/title), corrected to `fMulerVerdictState(key, true) == null` as single source of truth. OC disagreement stays on record (console, info panel, REVIEW tables). Cache-busters `?v=54.17`.
